 %20BC\,%20V2L%202J6%20Canada" target="_blank">(map)</a></li><li><a href="ht
 tp://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&amp\;text=Workshop%20-%2
 0STUFF%20THAT%20WORKS%21%20Songwriting%20Workshop%20with%20Linda%20McRae&am
