 ff-that-works-songwriting-workshop-with-linda-mcrae?format=ical">ICS</a></l
 i></ul><br><p>We are honoured to kick off the Coldsnap Workshop/IceJam even
 ts with a songwriting workshop hosted by the one and only Linda McRae. Ever
 ybody has a story to tell. Let’s explore ways to find your unique voice and
  create your own stories. Got writer’s block? Linda will present a raft of 
 tips and tricks to get the creative juices flowing again. Open to all level
 s and experiences. Bring a writing utensil\, no instrument needed.</p>
